{"id":"wb-8-414","name":"来宾文辉塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"文辉塔","text":"文辉塔，位于中国广西壮族自治区来宾市兴宾区迁江镇扶济村，万历年间由八所指挥黄文辉建成，故名“文辉”。2009年5月4日公布为第六批广西壮族自治区文物保护单位，2019年10月7日公布为第八批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%96%87%E8%BE%89%E5%A1%94","revisionId":86476775,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86476775","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/6644862de7975599216e91f2.jpg","title":"文辉塔_-_panoramio.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E6%96%87%E8%BE%89%E5%A1%94_-_panoramio.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/84/%E6%96%87%E8%BE%89%E5%A1%94_-_panoramio.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"莫春誉","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"文辉塔","width":320,"height":240}}